# Variant & Shell Rules

**Entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · **Standards:** [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) §3.3, §3.6, §3.8 · **Deep dive:** [docs/ai/08-feature-variant-shell.md](../../docs/ai/08-feature-variant-shell.md)

## Scope

- `variantscreen` — loads JSON pages, orchestrates cubits + `ScreenRenderer`
- `shell` — `TabShellWidget` bottom navigation from `NavigationConfig`

## Must

- Load pages via `AssetVariantRepository` / `variant_repository.dart` (same `variantId` as `MobileAppConfig`)
- `EngineRequestMapper.collectRequests` before cubit loads
- Populate `dataContext`: `requests.{requestKey}`, `loadingRequestKeys`, `routeParams`
- Keep HTTP in cubits/repos — this layer only orchestrates

## Key files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `variant_repository.dart` | Builder JSON → `ScreenConfig` |
| `variant_screen.dart` | Integration hub (requests + render) |
| `variant_cubit.dart` | Page load states |
| `tab_shell_widget.dart` | Tabs from config |

## User messages (auth host)

- `_AuthRequestHost` in `variant_screen.dart` — auth feedback via **`AppMessenger`** (not `SnackBar`)
- See [RULES.md §3.10](../../RULES.md#310-in-app-user-messages-appmessenger)

## Must not

- Duplicate JSON parsing outside `variant_repository.dart`
- `ScaffoldMessenger.showSnackBar` for user-facing messages in this feature
- Add standalone `GoRoute` to custom widgets for routes already in JSON
- Change `requestKey` wiring without checking mapper + cubit map

## Debugging

Blank UI: `pages[]` route, `requestUrl` pattern, cubit error state, renderer `unsupported` fallback.

Request UI phases: `lib/engine/request_ui_state.dart`
